{"id":"61daa6066fb2ea14","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Left Kan Extension","display":"df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Left Kan Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Left Kan Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-natural-transformation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension — ZFC Cat2 Left Kan Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"58-df-natural-transformation\">58-df-natural-transformation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E\\)</span> (source, target, and value categories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (functor along which extension is computed)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (source functor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (candidate left Kan extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:F\\Rightarrow L\\circ K\">\\(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow L\\circ K\\)</span> (unit natural transformation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"58-df-natural-transformation\">58-df-natural-transformation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}left\\text{-}kan\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S(L,\\eta,F,K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E,K_0,K_1,F_0,F_1,L_0,L_1\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\\land\\mathcal E=\\langle E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E\\rangle\\\\&amp;\\land K=\\langle K_0,K_1\\rangle\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land L=\\langle L_0,L_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(L,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,\\langle L_0\\circ K_0,L_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall H,H_0,H_1,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle H_0,H_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\alpha,F,\\langle H_0\\circ K_0,H_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,L,H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\alpha(X)=c_E(\\langle\\theta(K_0(X)),\\eta(X)\\rangle)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}left\\text{-}kan\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S(L,\\eta,F,K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E,K_0,K_1,F_0,F_1,L_0,L_1\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\\land\\mathcal E=\\langle E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E\\rangle\\\\&amp;\\land K=\\langle K_0,K_1\\rangle\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land L=\\langle L_0,L_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(L,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,\\langle L_0\\circ K_0,L_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall H,H_0,H_1,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle H_0,H_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\alpha,F,\\langle H_0\\circ K_0,H_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,L,H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\alpha(X)=c_E(\\langle\\theta(K_0(X)),\\eta(X)\\rangle)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the universal natural-transformation definition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lan}_K F\">\\(\\operatorname{Lan}_K F\\)</span>. The factorization equality is expanded componentwise using the target category's composition map, rather than hidden whiskering and vertical-composition operators.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[58-df-natural-transformation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:F\\Rightarrow L\\circ K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}left\\text{-}kan\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LeftKanExtension}_S(L,\\eta,F,K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E,K_0,K_1,F_0,F_1,L_0,L_1\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\\land\\mathcal E=\\langle E_0,E_1,s_E,t_E,c_E,e_E\\rangle\\\\&\\land K=\\langle K_0,K_1\\rangle\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land L=\\langle L_0,L_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(L,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,\\langle L_0\\circ K_0,L_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\\\&\\land\\forall H,H_0,H_1,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle H_0,H_1\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\alpha,F,\\langle H_0\\circ K_0,H_1\\circ K_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,L,H,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\\\&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\alpha(X)=c_E(\\langle\\theta(K_0(X)),\\eta(X)\\rangle)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lan}_K F","display":false}],"bytes":2633,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1583","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-left-kan-extension]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","877f1061e295cf5f","970e2b8779070da0"]}